      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/science/mothra-telescope-helix-nebula.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/science/mothra-telescope-helix-nebula.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>During early calibration tests, the MOTHRA telescope’s array of lenses, which will soon number 1,140, captured stellar debris dissolving into space around the Helix Nebula.</description>
      <dc:creator>K. R. Callaway</dc:creator>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:00:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Stars and Galaxies</category>
